WEBVTT

1
00:00.000 --> 00:03.500
Drop a stream recording, or paste a Twitch, YouTube or Kick link.

2
00:03.500 --> 00:07.500
SharkyClips finds the best moments and makes the clips by itself.

3
00:07.500 --> 00:13.500
Left: the stream. Right: the finished clip, cut to 9:16, with subtitles.

4
00:13.500 --> 00:19.500
The clip starts and ends with the words, so no sentence is cut in half.

5
00:19.500 --> 00:25.000
Every clip gets a title and a score, so the best ones are on top.

6
00:25.000 --> 00:31.000
One Share button for YouTube Shorts, TikTok and Instagram Reels.
